OL,3,GNEWSANew prison space plan announced,
OL,4,Aas Burnham set to address Commons for
OL,5,Afirst time as PM
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe government has set out plans to
OL,8,Fbuild more prison spaces, after Andy
OL,9,FBurnham tightened plans to release more
OL,10,Finmates early
OL,12,FOn Sunday, Burnham said people
OL,13,Fconvicted of unlawful killing -
OL,14,Fincluding manslaughter - would not be
OL,15,Feligible for earlier release in England
OL,16,Fand Wales
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
