OL,2,W//%*// //%Q,. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSANew prison space plan announced,
OL,4,Aas Burnham set to address Commons for
OL,5,Afirst time as PM
OL,6,
OL,7,FThat came after a summer of rows,
OL,8,Ffocused on two of PC Andrew Harper's
OL,9,Fkillers - who would have been released
OL,10,Fafter half their sentence, had the
OL,11,Fpolicy not changed. See a timeline of
OL,12,Fthe row here
OL,14,FThe government now says it's spending
OL,15,F#110m on new prison spaces, with
OL,16,F"existing space" in prisons "converted
OL,17,Finto cells"
OL,19,FThat existing space will include
OL,20,F"unused office space, laundry rooms and
OL,21,Fstorage areas"
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
